SUMMARY:ACCR FUN RIDE - LC Muggles Meander (21.9F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: John Cardos\
 nSweep: Lori Ann Kobzina\nAnticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mph\nRoute: [Mug
 gles Meander](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27009622)\n\n**Be Safe\, Have
  Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a FUN RIDE ride. The ride leader wil
 l ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group rid
 e with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her be
 st to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting
  into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join
  this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group.\n\nHelmets are m
 andatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tub
 e\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen
  and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below t
 o join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Joi
 n here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page
 _id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club
 's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an i
 ncident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.a
 spx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
