DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nThis is the June All Club Ride Long for the A and B
  rides. Following the ride\, please join us at [Bierhall](https://www.bier
