 and fellowship\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-terr
 e-hill-43r/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-terre-hill-43r/)\
 n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed for the [Ride
