  no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to ke
 ep the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also b
 e appointed at the start.\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not wil
 ling to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be r
 iding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining th
 e advertised average pace is beyond your current ability level\, please co
 nsider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. 
 Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump
 /CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we
  require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Bein
